==Battleground==
*3 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*3 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 6.67~8.33 seconds<sup>200f~250f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Angelic Gory]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
The only real threat is a single 100% Angelic Gory. [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Artist Cat]] will easily stall the Gory, and using other attackers will make short work of it.

